+That final implementation review inspected signed/pushed GREEN
+`2b3080d6562881ecd2a129dc3d896e9e9a86650d` in a clean detached checkout.
+Prompt SHA-256 is
+`891d559783217819352ed2ac62271e67eba531454550c2d47e1e490642baf669`.
